abstract: >-
  Agent Authority is a task-bounded execution layer for AI agents. The V1 research
  package studies evidence-grounded dynamic resource authority and deterministic
  selection witnesses under a fixed effect ceiling, with deterministic,
  provider-boundary, and partial live-model evaluation artifacts.
